{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Iczer Reborn","In deep space a battle wages between the forces of good and evil and the fate of the Earth hangs in the balance. The evil Neos Gold dispatches her invading forces towards Earth with only one aim: the total destruction of all mankind. Now it's up to Iczer 3 (the younger sister of Iczer 1) to defend the Earth from the deadly armada of Neos Gold, with only the Earth's single remaining battle cruiser on her side. But don't count her out; what Iczer 3 lacks in experience she makes up for in all-out enthusiasm."],"ja":["冒険！イクサー３",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":2291,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":1831,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-2292","ids":{"shikimori":2292,"mal":2292,"anilist":2292,"kodik":"serial-41539"},"kodikIds":["serial-41539"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-41539":"2022-03-25T15:16:46Z"},"title":"Приключения Икзер-3","originalTitle":"Bouken! Iczer 3","alt":"Возрождение Икзер /  Adventures With Iczer 3 / Iczer Reborn Iczer Reborn 冒険！イクサー３","description":"В глубоком космосе идёт сражение между силами добра и зла, от результатов которого зависит судьба Земли. Злобная Неос Голд отправила свою армию вторжения на Землю с одной единственной целью — полное уничтожение всего человечества. Теперь Икзер-3 , младшая сестра Икзер-1 , должна защитить Землю, притом, что в наличии у неё только один оставшийся на Земле боевой крейсер...","year":1990,"type":"OVA","genres":["Приключения","Фантастика","меха"],"rating":6.01,"popularity":1554,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[2291,1831],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/2292/f9cd1cd8da167ec040ab992e58ac3abf.jpeg","width":280,"height":395},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/d34e119f15db46ea5868c765e2c4d4888e58dad4.JPG","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":2,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-869","dubId":"869","label":"Субтитры","language":"ja","